This project shows the sales 'for' online store,
I have used Power BI 'for' this project applied full ETL process starting from importing the data from
its source into uploading the data to power query and applying data cleaning and transformation process,
then applying data modeling as I used snowflake schema 'for' this data.

Then moving into building the semantic layer using DAX queries,
the final step was building the dasboard and showing business overall performance.
